000062F8                            ; not used
000062F8                            
000062F8                            ; This is just like Calc_VRAM_Pos, but seemingly for an earlier
000062F8                            ; VRAM layout: the only difference is the high bits of the
000062F8                            ; plane's VRAM address, which are 10 instead of 11.
000062F8                            ; Both the foreground and background are at $C000 and $E000
000062F8                            ; respectively, so this one starting at $8000 makes no sense.
000062F8                            ; sub_6C3C:
000062F8                            Calc_VRAM_Pos_Unknown:
